/// imported
state cbi-violation-found: "CBI Protective-Order Violation Found" by office cite cfr210.34.b
{
  group discovery-group
  note "A nominally 'public version' that still contains unredacted CBI is the unauthorized-disclosure event 19 CFR 210.34(b) requires immediately reporting to both the submitter and the ALJ. Flag itc337/cbi-protective-order-violated is raised — no FRCP analog exists; this is a disqualification risk for the individual attorney, not merely a discovery-sanction risk."
