/// imported
terminal counsel-disqualified: "Counsel Disqualified from the Investigation" outcome [loss, procedural-default] cite cfr210.34.c
{
  group discovery-group
  note "Official Commission reprimand, disqualification from further participation in the investigation, potential permanent disqualification from Commission practice, and referral to state licensing authorities. A genuine ITC-specific permadeath terminal with no FRCP counterpart — mishandling CBI ends the responsible lawyer's role in the matter, not just the client's discovery position. PLACEHOLDER PAYOFF: $0, override per matter. Modeled as ending the matter for the self side's own counsel; if this disqualifies opposing counsel instead, the outcome for self is very different -- override once it's clear whose counsel this was."
  valence bad
  payoff 0.usd
}
